WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.590
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:27.860 --> 00:33.740
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

3
00:35.780 --> 00:41.740
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

4
00:42.780 --> 00:47.020
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

5
00:50.700 --> 00:58.260
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

6
00:58.620 --> 01:05.380
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

7
01:06.620 --> 01:13.260
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

8
01:14.460 --> 01:21.300
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

9
01:22.900 --> 01:29.420
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

10
01:34.180 --> 01:35.980
[Blossom in Darkness]

11
01:35.980 --> 01:37.980
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

12
01:37.980 --> 01:40.980
[Episode 1]

13
01:42.110 --> 01:43.890
Heaven and Earth give life to all things.

14
01:44.240 --> 01:46.060
And all things have spirits.

15
01:46.550 --> 01:47.290
I

16
01:47.600 --> 01:49.580
am a Moonlit Revival Herb,

17
01:50.110 --> 01:52.250
awakened by Danshen, master of Luoshen Valley.

18
01:52.720 --> 01:53.940
He took me as his disciple

19
01:54.190 --> 01:55.620
and raised me with care and kindness.

20
02:08.860 --> 02:10.200
[Danshen, Guardian of the Saintess of the Tides]

21
02:10.200 --> 02:10.740
Master.

22
02:10.990 --> 02:12.200
I know what my name should be.

23
02:12.200 --> 02:13.100
Yamao. [*duck feather]

24
02:14.080 --> 02:15.300
Eating a Moonlit Revival Herb

25
02:15.430 --> 02:17.250
can make you immortal.

26
02:17.590 --> 02:20.180
That's why so many demons covet me.

27
02:20.180 --> 02:20.870
[Yamao]

28
02:20.870 --> 02:21.900
[Moonlit Revival Herb Spirit] Each night,

29
02:21.990 --> 02:22.900
bathed in moonlight,

30
02:23.270 --> 02:25.740
I'm an all-powerful herb spirit.

31
02:26.870 --> 02:27.490
But...

32
02:31.760 --> 02:32.620
when daylight comes,

33
02:33.200 --> 02:34.340
all my powers vanish,

34
02:35.040 --> 02:36.570
and I'm just a helpless blade of grass.

35
02:52.430 --> 02:52.970
Found it!

36
02:55.420 --> 02:56.870
[Luoshen Residence]

37
02:56.870 --> 02:58.180
Master suffers from a chronic illness.

38
02:58.800 --> 02:59.570
He always says

39
03:00.080 --> 03:01.810
ordinary herbs from outside the mountains will do.

40
03:03.430 --> 03:04.180
But I know

41
03:04.920 --> 03:06.500
that to truly ease his suffering,

42
03:07.520 --> 03:09.090
his medicine needs my spirit essence.

43
03:27.870 --> 03:28.970
Master, how are you feeling?

44
03:29.200 --> 03:29.850
Does it still hurt?

45
03:30.390 --> 03:31.370
Whenever you bleed,

46
03:31.830 --> 03:32.810
you lose vital energy.

47
03:33.240 --> 03:34.690
I didn't keep you by my side

48
03:34.830 --> 03:36.020
to hurt you.

49
03:37.360 --> 03:38.780
As long as it heals Master,

50
03:40.080 --> 03:41.370
what does losing some vital energy matter?

51
03:43.390 --> 03:44.090
Soon,

52
03:44.710 --> 03:46.020
the Wish Tree will appear.

53
03:46.360 --> 03:47.460
Once I hang this doll

54
03:47.800 --> 03:49.340
that represents both of us on the tree,

55
03:49.960 --> 03:50.970
I can stay by Master's side

56
03:51.520 --> 03:53.690
year after year.

57
04:08.080 --> 04:10.370
But a rain of fire from the heavens has destroyed everything.

58
04:14.870 --> 04:15.650
A thousand years ago,

59
04:16.120 --> 04:18.330
the world's malice gave rise to Qi Fengyin, the Devil Incarnate.

60
04:19.200 --> 04:20.300
Brutal and merciless,

61
04:20.790 --> 04:21.770
he slaughtered countless lives.

62
04:22.760 --> 04:24.890
The Saintess of the Tides sealed him within Mount Qihuang.

63
04:25.640 --> 04:26.450
Her strength exhausted,

64
04:27.910 --> 04:30.620
her spirit lay dormant in a shrine in Luoshen Valley,

65
04:32.030 --> 04:33.500
which Master guarded day and night.

66
04:33.500 --> 04:35.380
[Saintess's Shrine]

67
04:38.440 --> 04:40.500
Day after day, Qi Fengyin absorbed malice

68
04:41.150 --> 04:42.100
to nourish his demonic body.

69
04:43.270 --> 04:43.810
Now,

70
04:44.590 --> 04:46.100
he is about to break through the seal again.

71
04:47.620 --> 04:50.220
[Mount Zhaowu, Foremost of the Immortal Sects]

72
04:56.860 --> 04:57.780
[Yinhua, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

73
04:57.780 --> 04:58.940
[Zhiwei, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

74
04:58.940 --> 04:59.860
[Qingxing, Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

75
05:00.060 --> 05:02.910
[Yuwen Hao, Chief Disciple of Mount Zhaowu]

76
05:02.910 --> 05:03.370
Form the array!

77
05:32.080 --> 05:33.130
No one expected

78
05:34.270 --> 05:36.810
the devil to launch a firestorm against Luoshen Valley

79
05:37.640 --> 05:39.370
to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.

80
05:40.760 --> 05:41.690
And my master,

81
05:42.520 --> 05:43.660
sworn to guard her spirit,

82
05:44.470 --> 05:45.690
fought to the very end.

83
06:18.230 --> 06:18.980
Master.

84
06:20.590 --> 06:21.210
Master.

85
06:21.560 --> 06:22.060
Master...

86
06:22.590 --> 06:23.130
Master!

87
06:27.340 --> 06:28.030
Master.

88
06:28.880 --> 06:29.790
Master, hold on.

89
06:30.290 --> 06:31.560
I'll take you somewhere to heal in seclusion.

90
06:31.760 --> 06:32.740
You're going to be all right.

91
06:33.140 --> 06:33.600
Master?

92
06:37.120 --> 06:37.690
Yamao.

93
06:39.150 --> 06:39.690
This...

94
06:40.640 --> 06:41.250
This is...

95
06:42.120 --> 06:44.300
a magical artifact I made for you.

96
06:45.000 --> 06:45.740
It can mask

97
06:45.790 --> 06:48.370
your scent as a medicinal herb.

98
06:49.320 --> 06:50.130
From now on,

99
06:50.830 --> 06:51.890
even if you're hurt,

100
06:52.640 --> 06:54.660
you won't attract demons.

101
06:59.520 --> 07:01.300
You knew something would happen to you,

102
07:02.560 --> 07:03.250
didn't you?

103
07:04.830 --> 07:06.940
I can't always be by your side.

104
07:08.030 --> 07:09.370
There are some things

105
07:09.960 --> 07:11.570
you have to face on your own.

106
07:12.470 --> 07:13.770
I don't want this ring.

107
07:15.230 --> 07:15.860
Master,

108
07:16.080 --> 07:16.980
let me heal you.

109
07:17.520 --> 07:19.210
Please don't leave me behind.

110
07:19.440 --> 07:19.810
Please?

111
07:21.680 --> 07:22.660
Go to Mount Zhaowu

112
07:23.760 --> 07:24.620
and find Du Zhong.

113
07:25.640 --> 07:28.060
He can protect you from now on.

114
07:28.320 --> 07:29.980
I don't want Uncle Du.

115
07:31.590 --> 07:33.210
I'm not going to Mount Zhaowu.

116
07:34.120 --> 07:35.620
I just want you, Master.

117
07:51.830 --> 07:52.810
Master.

118
07:55.120 --> 07:56.130
Master.

119
07:58.000 --> 07:59.250
Master!

120
08:02.270 --> 08:02.890
Master...

121
08:12.440 --> 08:13.720
Master!

122
08:32.160 --> 08:33.260
Master...

123
09:23.350 --> 09:24.260
Those are heartbeats.

124
09:25.630 --> 09:26.180
Master,

125
09:27.680 --> 09:29.260
you're still alive, aren't you?

126
09:30.600 --> 09:32.010
You won't just die like this.

127
09:32.630 --> 09:34.060
I'll go to Mount Zhaowu right now.

128
09:34.930 --> 09:35.920
I'll find Uncle Du.

129
09:36.350 --> 09:37.610
He'll know how to save you.

130
09:44.870 --> 09:46.090
O Saintess of the Tides,

131
09:49.080 --> 09:50.140
I have little strength

132
09:50.230 --> 09:51.670
and cannot protect you.

133
09:52.440 --> 09:54.370
Your guardian is dying now.

134
09:56.080 --> 09:57.090
If you won't save him,

135
09:58.400 --> 09:59.380
I will.

136
10:10.500 --> 10:13.220
[Mount Zhaowu]

137
10:16.870 --> 10:17.420
Master,

138
10:18.080 --> 10:19.180
the dark energy on Mount Qihuang is surging.

139
10:19.510 --> 10:20.140
Should we

140
10:20.140 --> 10:20.680
[Du Zhong]

141
10:20.680 --> 10:21.810
[Leader of Mount Zhaowu] inform High Immortal Danshen?

142
10:22.680 --> 10:24.180
I'm afraid Danshen may not survive.

143
10:24.800 --> 10:26.100
Qi Fengyin is about to break free.

144
10:26.560 --> 10:28.210
He'll surely try to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.

145
10:29.750 --> 10:30.210
Hao,

146
10:31.400 --> 10:32.380
go to Luoshen Valley at once

147
10:32.870 --> 10:33.660
and find out what's happened.

148
10:34.230 --> 10:35.940
You must keep the shrine intact.

149
10:36.280 --> 10:36.940
Yes, Master.

150
10:37.400 --> 10:38.260
You must find

151
10:38.560 --> 10:39.490
Danshen's disciple.

152
10:39.920 --> 10:41.380
She's a Moonlit Revival Herb spirit.

153
10:41.710 --> 10:43.060
By day, she's defenseless.

154
10:43.940 --> 10:44.960
Without someone to protect her,

155
10:45.510 --> 10:46.780
she'll be in grave danger.

156
10:52.470 --> 10:52.940
What's wrong?

157
10:54.440 --> 10:54.850
Master,

158
10:56.160 --> 10:57.730
could you send others to find her?

159
10:59.110 --> 10:59.690
I know

160
10:59.750 --> 11:01.060
you've never liked that girl.

161
11:01.680 --> 11:03.090
But this is an emergency.

162
11:03.470 --> 11:04.090
Have someone

163
11:04.680 --> 11:05.850
prepare the Immortal Beacon.

164
11:06.230 --> 11:07.730
Long ago, the immortal sects

165
11:07.960 --> 11:09.060
swore a blood oath

166
11:09.510 --> 11:10.410
that whenever they see the beacon,

167
11:10.800 --> 11:11.690
they must all assemble.

168
11:13.350 --> 11:13.830
Yes, Master.

169
11:20.620 --> 11:22.740
[Summons]

170
11:22.940 --> 11:26.500
[Lin Yuemi, Leader of Shanhai Vale]

171
11:26.500 --> 11:28.740
[Summons]

172
11:30.140 --> 11:33.100
[Cheng Li, Leader of Wuwang Sect]

173
11:34.620 --> 11:36.500
[Summons]

174
11:36.740 --> 11:38.660
[Cang Zhu, Leader of Luoliang Immortal Sect]

175
11:44.940 --> 11:49.860
[Summons]

176
12:01.420 --> 12:05.340
[Su Hexiang, Leader of Mount Leiguan]

177
12:05.350 --> 12:06.490
The world

178
12:07.400 --> 12:08.690
is truly about to change.

179
13:14.510 --> 13:15.570
Mount Leiguan's carriage?

180
13:17.470 --> 13:18.380
What's it doing here?

181
13:46.800 --> 13:48.420
You poor girl.

182
13:49.630 --> 13:50.570
Are you the leader of Mount Leiguan,

183
13:51.230 --> 13:51.970
Su Hexiang?

184
13:53.870 --> 13:54.900
So you do remember me.

185
13:55.230 --> 13:56.610
I heard the upheaval on Mount Qihuang

186
13:57.470 --> 13:59.060
wreaked havoc on Luoshen Valley.

187
13:59.350 --> 14:01.020
My master is badly hurt.

188
14:01.440 --> 14:02.780
I'm on my way to Mount Zhaowu

189
14:02.990 --> 14:04.140
to ask Master Du for help.

190
14:04.630 --> 14:06.660
Luoshen Valley isn't far from Mount Leiguan.

191
14:07.160 --> 14:08.420
When I heard the news,

192
14:08.750 --> 14:09.780
I came at once.

193
14:11.680 --> 14:12.660
Now that I know you're safe,

194
14:13.230 --> 14:14.060
I can rest easy.

195
14:15.160 --> 14:15.900
You there,

196
14:16.110 --> 14:17.810
help Miss Yamao into the carriage.

197
14:17.990 --> 14:18.490
Yes.

198
14:19.680 --> 14:20.280
Wait.

199
14:21.830 --> 14:22.900
Madam Su,

200
14:24.230 --> 14:25.250
I left in such a hurry

201
14:25.400 --> 14:26.850
that I forgot an important keepsake from my master.

202
14:27.110 --> 14:27.650
I...

203
14:27.650 --> 14:28.980
If it's an important keepsake,

204
14:29.750 --> 14:30.730
go and get it.

205
14:42.080 --> 14:42.900
Take her away.

206
14:43.920 --> 14:44.690
Don't hurt her.

207
14:51.920 --> 14:53.140
Awake already?

208
14:58.960 --> 15:00.660
You weren't easy to catch, little herb spirit.

209
15:01.590 --> 15:02.900
Mount Leiguan is a major immortal sect,

210
15:03.200 --> 15:04.210
one of the Five Great Sects.

211
15:04.590 --> 15:05.060
Aren't you worried

212
15:05.510 --> 15:06.730
that eating me will harm your cultivation?

213
15:11.510 --> 15:12.610
So you've already guessed

214
15:12.630 --> 15:13.660
why I've come.

215
15:19.830 --> 15:21.060
Blame the fact

216
15:21.560 --> 15:23.660
that your flesh can make others immortal.

217
15:24.870 --> 15:26.380
Without Danshen to protect you,

218
15:27.440 --> 15:28.380
sooner or later,

219
15:28.440 --> 15:29.780
someone will make a meal of you.

220
15:31.040 --> 15:32.450
Why shouldn't it be me?

221
15:34.080 --> 15:35.420
Everyone says

222
15:35.990 --> 15:37.610
you give off a medicinal scent.

223
15:38.160 --> 15:39.260
Why can't I smell it?

224
15:39.960 --> 15:41.450
Since you're so curious, Madam Su,

225
15:42.680 --> 15:43.940
let me show you.

226
16:09.320 --> 16:10.060
Has she lost her mind,

227
16:11.110 --> 16:12.540
running into Mount Qihuang?

228
16:16.440 --> 16:18.140
Even if you hide on Mount Qihuang,

229
16:19.560 --> 16:21.260
when I want something,

230
16:22.400 --> 16:24.090
I never let it escape.

231
16:24.350 --> 16:24.850
After her!

232
16:27.440 --> 16:28.000
Madam,

233
16:28.750 --> 16:29.810
Qi Fengyin is imprisoned here.

234
16:30.400 --> 16:31.180
If we go in,

235
16:32.320 --> 16:34.060
can we still get back out alive?

236
16:34.230 --> 16:35.380
Qi Fengyin's been stripped of his powers

237
16:35.380 --> 16:36.260
as the Devil Incarnate.

238
16:36.920 --> 16:38.180
He's nothing like he once was.

239
16:39.230 --> 16:39.840
Don't worry.

240
16:40.920 --> 16:42.420
I'll stay outside and back you up.

241
17:00.260 --> 17:03.740
[Mount Qihuang]

242
17:05.030 --> 17:06.290
Mount...

243
17:06.790 --> 17:07.530
Mount Qihuang?

244
17:18.960 --> 17:19.420
Stay back!

245
17:19.710 --> 17:20.690
This is Mount Qihuang.

246
17:21.440 --> 17:22.490
If you come any closer,

247
17:23.030 --> 17:23.730
I'll scream

248
17:23.920 --> 17:24.900
and bring Qi Fengyin here.

249
17:25.790 --> 17:27.140
If I have to die,

250
17:27.410 --> 17:28.400
I'll take you down with me.

251
17:28.640 --> 17:29.730
If we capture you,

252
17:30.270 --> 17:31.600
your primal spirit will survive.

253
17:31.750 --> 17:33.530
But if that devil Qi Fengyin gets you,

254
17:34.160 --> 17:35.690
he'll tear you apart

255
17:35.840 --> 17:36.800
and grind you to dust.

256
18:01.790 --> 18:02.250
Thank you...

257
18:15.360 --> 18:15.860
Qi...

258
18:16.230 --> 18:16.940
Qi Fengyin!

259
18:17.420 --> 18:20.030
[Qi Fengyin]

260
18:20.030 --> 18:20.490
Get lost.

261
18:33.510 --> 18:34.660
Madam Su was right.

262
18:35.200 --> 18:36.940
Without his powers as the Devil Incarnate,

263
18:36.990 --> 18:37.900
he's nothing like he once was.

264
18:38.470 --> 18:39.970
His first strike almost scared us off.

265
18:40.270 --> 18:41.290
This is a blessing in disguise.

266
18:41.470 --> 18:42.210
Let's take this chance

267
18:42.310 --> 18:43.250
and kill this devil.

268
18:43.790 --> 18:44.900
We'll be famous throughout the world!

269
18:45.440 --> 18:46.420
While they're at each other's throats,

270
18:47.030 --> 18:48.450
I might still have a chance to escape.

271
18:52.400 --> 18:52.860
Attack!

272
19:16.960 --> 19:17.860
She was as good as mine.

273
19:18.440 --> 19:19.820
Now Qi Fengyin gets her instead.

274
19:25.600 --> 19:26.140
I...

275
19:27.470 --> 19:28.490
I'm not like them.

276
19:29.310 --> 19:30.010
You told me to leave,

277
19:30.550 --> 19:31.380
so I'll leave right away.

278
19:36.120 --> 19:37.180
W... Wait.

279
19:37.310 --> 19:38.000
I'll go right away.

280
19:38.680 --> 19:39.900
I didn't tell you to leave.

281
19:59.790 --> 20:00.290
Oh, no.

282
20:01.230 --> 20:02.770
Does he know what I really am?

283
20:03.600 --> 20:05.080
I can't just let him devour me.

284
20:05.470 --> 20:06.660
I'll fight him to the death

285
20:07.360 --> 20:08.450
and avenge Master.

286
20:21.440 --> 20:21.900
Please...

287
20:22.550 --> 20:23.450
Don't get the wrong idea.

288
20:24.700 --> 20:25.730
I'm trying to save you.

289
20:27.360 --> 20:28.930
I can relieve your pain.

290
20:29.270 --> 20:31.020
Those black markings on your face

291
20:31.120 --> 20:32.340
are signs of your condition.

292
20:32.340 --> 20:34.060
Do you constantly feel

293
20:34.230 --> 20:35.100
a deep, stabbing pain

294
20:35.230 --> 20:36.010
and a searing heat?

295
20:37.160 --> 20:38.730
I know how to ease it.

296
20:47.750 --> 20:49.770
This spirit essence calms the mind

297
20:49.960 --> 20:51.580
and cures every ailment in the world.

298
20:51.790 --> 20:54.340
You... You just have to drink it.

299
21:00.790 --> 21:02.290
I'm on your territory.

300
21:02.790 --> 21:04.380
I wouldn't dare cause trouble here, would I?

301
21:04.840 --> 21:06.340
If you don't believe me, you...

302
21:50.120 --> 21:51.180
You... You're welcome.

303
21:51.270 --> 21:53.180
Do you feel any better?

304
22:20.230 --> 22:20.860
Master!

305
22:29.920 --> 22:30.690
Master...

306
22:38.070 --> 22:39.940
After hiding all this time,

307
22:39.960 --> 22:42.340
I finally have a chance to possess a body.

308
22:55.180 --> 22:56.360
How did it end up there?

309
23:03.880 --> 23:05.530
I'm sure this is the way I came in.

310
23:06.750 --> 23:08.250
Why can't I find my way out?

311
23:10.990 --> 23:11.820
I smell flowers.

312
23:12.640 --> 23:14.070
Mount Qihuang is completely barren.

313
23:14.360 --> 23:15.840
I must be close to the way out.

314
23:56.120 --> 23:56.970
Qi Fengyin?

315
23:58.310 --> 23:59.660
So he's been absorbing malice

316
24:00.270 --> 24:02.010
to make that mystical flower bloom.

317
24:38.120 --> 24:39.380
That's my spirit essence.

318
25:26.750 --> 25:27.900
I didn't know this would happen.

319
25:28.270 --> 25:29.530
I really was trying to help you.

320
25:29.960 --> 25:30.820
What exactly

321
25:31.440 --> 25:32.840
did you come here for?

322
25:33.200 --> 25:33.580
I...

323
25:34.230 --> 25:36.140
My spirit essence can calm the mind

324
25:37.470 --> 25:38.860
and ease your pain.

325
25:39.310 --> 25:40.180
But I didn't know

326
25:40.360 --> 25:41.430
it would also dispel the malice

327
25:41.430 --> 25:42.100
you'd absorbed.

328
25:42.100 --> 25:43.170
Liar.

329
26:02.140 --> 26:02.920
Stop!

330
26:06.790 --> 26:07.660
You've been absorbing malice

331
26:08.400 --> 26:10.240
to make this mystical seed bloom.

332
26:10.680 --> 26:11.740
So this seed

333
26:12.360 --> 26:13.520
is as precious to you as your own life,

334
26:13.840 --> 26:14.330
isn't it?

335
26:19.310 --> 26:20.140
Put it down.

336
26:20.750 --> 26:21.770
If you spare me,

337
26:22.600 --> 26:24.130
I promise it'll be safe.

338
26:34.440 --> 26:34.820
How...

339
26:35.680 --> 26:35.970
How...

340
26:38.690 --> 26:39.270
How did it...?

341
26:44.880 --> 26:46.330
It went into my body all by itself.

342
26:46.330 --> 26:47.150
I didn't do anything!

343
26:48.960 --> 26:49.580
Qi Fengyin,

344
26:49.880 --> 26:50.690
think this through.

345
26:51.120 --> 26:51.600
If you kill me,

346
26:51.600 --> 26:52.480
there'll be no one left

347
26:52.480 --> 26:53.640
to ease your pain.

348
26:53.920 --> 26:54.980
Killing me over one little seed?

349
26:55.240 --> 26:56.220
Is it really worth it?

350
27:01.920 --> 27:04.460
Qi Fengyin, you'll regret this.

351
28:59.870 --> 29:00.290
Master.

352
29:01.550 --> 29:02.090
What did you find?

353
29:02.960 --> 29:04.220
Luoshen Valley was ravaged by the firestorm

354
29:04.550 --> 29:05.740
and nearly razed to the ground.

355
29:06.240 --> 29:07.460
Luckily, the shrine is unharmed.

356
29:07.830 --> 29:08.940
I've ordered the disciples who came with me

357
29:09.040 --> 29:09.770
to stay and guard it.

358
29:12.240 --> 29:13.500
Good. At least the shrine is safe.

359
29:15.480 --> 29:16.420
Did you find Danshen

360
29:16.590 --> 29:17.370
and his disciple?

361
29:17.720 --> 29:19.090
I searched the entire valley

362
29:20.200 --> 29:21.610
but found no trace of either of them.

363
29:22.790 --> 29:23.610
The shrine, however,

364
29:23.870 --> 29:25.180
had been carefully concealed.

365
29:26.040 --> 29:27.460
Miss Yamao must have done it.

366
29:28.390 --> 29:29.090
Then

367
29:29.550 --> 29:30.420
she must still be alive.

368
29:31.440 --> 29:32.500
But given what she is,

369
29:33.000 --> 29:34.180
once she leaves Luoshen Valley,

370
29:34.590 --> 29:36.020
she's bound to cause an uproar.

371
29:36.240 --> 29:37.020
There was little time,

372
29:37.350 --> 29:38.530
so the shrine had to come first.

373
29:39.170 --> 29:40.340
As for Miss Yamao...

374
29:47.960 --> 29:48.740
Right now,

375
29:49.960 --> 29:51.290
we have a more pressing matter.

376
29:56.200 --> 29:57.940
Greetings, Master Du.

377
29:58.520 --> 29:59.290
The situation is dire.

378
29:59.630 --> 30:00.900
There's no need for formalities.

379
30:01.040 --> 30:02.700
Is the news sent with the Immortal Beacon

380
30:02.920 --> 30:03.420
really true?

381
30:04.310 --> 30:05.420
How could the seal on Mount Qihuang

382
30:05.550 --> 30:06.740
have weakened so suddenly?

383
30:07.000 --> 30:07.610
Though Qi Fengyin

384
30:07.830 --> 30:09.090
has been confined within the mountain,

385
30:09.550 --> 30:11.140
he's spent the last millennium

386
30:11.140 --> 30:12.570
absorbing the world's malice.

387
30:12.830 --> 30:14.700
He's on the verge of becoming the Devil Incarnate.

388
30:19.150 --> 30:20.050
A thousand years ago,

389
30:20.870 --> 30:21.770
this devil

390
30:22.110 --> 30:23.940
slaughtered immortals and mortals alike.

391
30:24.280 --> 30:26.020
The mountains of corpses and rivers of blood

392
30:26.310 --> 30:27.740
are still vivid in my mind.

393
30:40.390 --> 30:41.660
We must never let him escape.

394
30:43.200 --> 30:44.660
I've summoned you all today

395
30:45.200 --> 30:46.900
to reinforce the seal.

396
30:59.760 --> 31:01.330
This is the Wanjun Lock,

397
31:02.550 --> 31:04.370
a divine artifact left by the Saintess of the Tides.

398
31:04.920 --> 31:07.020
Only the power of all five immortal sanctuaries can activate it.

399
31:07.920 --> 31:09.700
It can reinforce the seal on Mount Qihuang

400
31:10.550 --> 31:12.180
and stop him from absorbing any more malice.

401
31:13.480 --> 31:14.090
We have to sacrifice

402
31:14.150 --> 31:15.740
the spiritual energy in our sects' sanctuaries?

403
31:16.680 --> 31:17.810
Even thousands of years of cultivation

404
31:17.830 --> 31:18.770
couldn't compare to it.

405
31:19.520 --> 31:21.180
If Qi Fengyin breaks free,

406
31:21.630 --> 31:23.130
the world will never know peace.

407
31:23.630 --> 31:24.370
Our sects

408
31:25.070 --> 31:26.290
will have to answer for it.

409
31:29.040 --> 31:31.020
I was merely making a remark.

410
31:31.920 --> 31:33.050
If the nest is destroyed,

411
31:33.680 --> 31:34.700
how can its eggs survive?

412
31:35.590 --> 31:36.500
Do you think

413
31:37.240 --> 31:38.420
I don't understand something so simple?

414
31:39.150 --> 31:39.900
Master Du,

415
31:40.350 --> 31:41.530
just tell us

416
31:41.790 --> 31:42.850
when the Wanjun Lock

417
31:43.000 --> 31:44.180
will be activated.

418
31:45.680 --> 31:46.180
Everyone,

419
31:46.630 --> 31:47.980
we'll form the array at the Zi hour tonight.

420
31:48.390 --> 31:49.420
The future of the world is at stake.

421
31:50.350 --> 31:52.260
There must be no mistakes.

422
31:53.200 --> 31:53.810
Yes.

423
31:54.790 --> 31:55.090
Yes.

424
32:17.520 --> 32:18.660
Am I dead or alive?

425
32:30.350 --> 32:30.770
You...

426
32:31.040 --> 32:32.610
You know you can't escape,

427
32:33.550 --> 32:34.700
yet you keep asking for trouble.

428
32:45.480 --> 32:46.460
Qi Fengyin,

429
32:46.920 --> 32:47.660
are you insane?

430
32:48.920 --> 32:49.900
You devil.

431
32:50.310 --> 32:51.130
How despicable.

432
32:51.760 --> 32:52.570
All I did was absorb

433
32:52.580 --> 32:53.530
one little seed of yours.

434
32:53.560 --> 32:54.500
And it went

435
32:54.520 --> 32:55.330
into my body by itself.

436
32:55.870 --> 32:57.180
Do you have to keep playing

437
32:57.280 --> 32:58.500
with my life like this?

438
32:58.760 --> 32:59.700
If you want me dead,

439
32:59.760 --> 33:00.660
just get it over with!

440
33:33.440 --> 33:34.220
No, wait.

441
33:35.310 --> 33:35.740
Wait.

442
33:38.720 --> 33:39.610
Where's my leaf?

443
33:40.000 --> 33:40.740
What's going on?

444
33:42.200 --> 33:43.090
Has your seed

445
33:43.200 --> 33:44.610
sprouted on my head?

446
33:45.110 --> 33:46.220
That's what I want to know.

447
33:46.870 --> 33:47.850
What did you do to it?

448
33:48.240 --> 33:50.050
What do you mean, what did I do to it?

449
33:50.200 --> 33:51.700
It's your seed that's clinging to me.

450
33:52.000 --> 33:52.290
I...

451
33:53.070 --> 33:54.260
Don't you dare pull it out.

452
34:06.480 --> 34:07.900
You were going to kill me.

453
34:08.520 --> 34:10.610
But it grew on my head

454
34:11.110 --> 34:12.340
and turned me into its flowerpot.

455
34:12.400 --> 34:12.980
That's why

456
34:13.670 --> 34:14.690
you saved me, isn't it?

457
34:15.070 --> 34:16.380
The less you talk,

458
34:16.920 --> 34:18.170
the longer I'll let you live.

459
34:19.230 --> 34:19.860
Fine.

460
34:20.670 --> 34:21.940
If you won't answer,

461
34:23.480 --> 34:24.730
I'll find out for myself.

462
34:32.480 --> 34:33.610
I see.

463
34:34.440 --> 34:35.570
Your precious seed's life

464
34:35.630 --> 34:37.130
is tied to mine now.

465
34:37.750 --> 34:39.780
So not only do you have to keep me alive...

466
34:42.190 --> 34:43.420
Ow! That hurts!

467
34:44.070 --> 34:44.760
Please, sir!

468
34:45.330 --> 34:46.170
Spare me!

469
34:50.590 --> 34:52.020
As long as I keep you alive,

470
34:52.550 --> 34:54.500
my seed will be fine.

471
34:55.230 --> 34:56.530
I was only joking.

472
34:59.960 --> 35:01.860
"A Guide to Mystical Flower Care"?

473
35:02.190 --> 35:04.420
Is this for taking care of the seed?

474
35:05.440 --> 35:06.730
So it's called a mystical flower.

475
35:07.880 --> 35:09.050
You don't even know

476
35:09.110 --> 35:10.210
what your own flower is called?

477
35:14.630 --> 35:16.370
Despite not knowing what the flower

478
35:16.370 --> 35:16.880
is called,

479
35:16.880 --> 35:17.610
you've managed

480
35:17.610 --> 35:18.820
to grow such a lovely flower.

481
35:19.000 --> 35:20.130
You have a real gift, sir.

482
35:28.270 --> 35:29.610
Do you recognize these little black dots

483
35:30.230 --> 35:30.900
on the pages?

484
35:31.070 --> 35:31.940
Black dots?

485
35:32.040 --> 35:33.610
You mean these words?

486
35:36.070 --> 35:37.420
You can't read?

487
35:38.520 --> 35:39.210
Can you read them?

488
35:40.840 --> 35:41.380
Yes.

489
35:41.630 --> 35:42.300
Of course I can.

490
35:45.320 --> 35:47.690
"Mystical flowers thrive in ground rich in spiritual energy

491
35:48.150 --> 35:50.170
and can choose fertile soil on their own.

492
35:50.440 --> 35:51.650
Within 12 hours,

493
35:51.800 --> 35:53.170
they put down deep roots."

494
35:54.880 --> 35:56.380
Fertile soil, huh?

495
35:56.880 --> 35:58.170
So it really is using me as a flowerpot.

496
35:58.670 --> 35:59.460
What is fertile soil?

497
36:02.750 --> 36:04.050
It means

498
36:06.360 --> 36:07.610
good soil.

499
36:10.630 --> 36:11.780
You're not good soil.

500
36:12.400 --> 36:13.340
If I'm not good soil,

501
36:13.750 --> 36:14.530
why is the mystical flower

502
36:14.590 --> 36:15.380
growing out of my head?

503
36:15.550 --> 36:16.130
Keep reading.

504
36:18.520 --> 36:19.620
"Mystical flowers are delicate

505
36:19.620 --> 36:20.980
and must never be transplanted by force.

506
36:21.670 --> 36:22.650
If transplanting is unavoidable,

507
36:22.670 --> 36:23.780
follow the instructions in this guide.

508
36:24.270 --> 36:25.300
Never pull the plant out by force.

509
36:25.880 --> 36:26.780
Only at midnight,

510
36:27.040 --> 36:27.860
when all things are renewed,

511
36:28.040 --> 36:28.980
may you attempt it.

512
36:29.480 --> 36:31.690
Once a mystical flower has taken deep root,

513
36:31.960 --> 36:33.940
it must never be transplanted.

514
36:34.110 --> 36:36.090
Keep this in mind at all times."

515
36:37.070 --> 36:38.380
So at midnight,

516
36:39.480 --> 36:41.130
I can still transplant it back.

517
36:42.960 --> 36:43.980
Transplant it back?

518
36:44.440 --> 36:45.020
No way.

519
36:45.440 --> 36:46.430
I've managed to offend

520
36:46.430 --> 36:47.690
Qi Fengyin in every possible way.

521
36:48.040 --> 36:49.500
The flower growing on my head

522
36:49.550 --> 36:50.860
is the only reason I'm still alive.

523
36:51.320 --> 36:52.780
If he really takes the flower away,

524
36:52.880 --> 36:54.090
he won't let me live.

525
36:54.920 --> 36:55.860
Try running again,

526
36:56.400 --> 36:57.900
and I'll cripple you on the spot.

527
37:04.880 --> 37:06.340
I was kind enough to read the guide to you.

528
37:06.710 --> 37:08.460
You can't just kill me once I've served my purpose.

529
37:14.190 --> 37:15.170
Once my powers return tonight,

530
37:15.480 --> 37:16.530
I'll find a way to escape.

531
37:16.820 --> 37:18.780
[Mount Zhaowu]

532
37:20.270 --> 37:21.090
The Zi hour is almost upon us.

533
37:21.630 --> 37:23.020
Tell every sect to get ready to form the array.

534
37:36.630 --> 37:37.210
It's night now.

535
37:57.840 --> 37:59.340
Is it midnight already?

536
38:10.270 --> 38:11.500
The guide lists so many warnings

537
38:11.550 --> 38:12.650
about transplanting mystical flowers.

538
38:12.880 --> 38:14.300
That means it's dangerous.

539
38:14.590 --> 38:15.570
Why are you so determined

540
38:15.630 --> 38:16.340
to separate it from me?

541
38:17.070 --> 38:18.500
I've only known you for a day.

542
38:19.550 --> 38:20.820
How many times have you lied to me already?

543
38:23.630 --> 38:24.380
I don't trust you.

544
38:24.440 --> 38:25.530
We may have had a few

545
38:25.530 --> 38:26.130
unpleasant moments,

546
38:26.630 --> 38:27.340
but I've always been

547
38:27.440 --> 38:28.380
generous and forgiving.

548
38:28.400 --> 38:29.090
I don't hold grudges.

549
38:29.270 --> 38:30.730
I promise I'll take good care of your flower.

550
38:30.840 --> 38:31.690
Besides, don't you get lonely

551
38:31.880 --> 38:33.090
all by yourself on Mount Qihuang?

552
38:33.270 --> 38:33.980
Why not keep me alive

553
38:34.110 --> 38:35.170
so you have someone to talk to?

554
38:36.070 --> 38:37.460
I don't want to hear you talk.

555
38:45.520 --> 38:46.570
I haven't finished reading

556
38:46.920 --> 38:48.340
that flower care guide to you yet.

557
39:07.520 --> 39:08.500
Why is the doll I made for Master

558
39:08.920 --> 39:09.680
moving?

559
39:09.750 --> 39:11.250
This is the body I want.

560
39:11.440 --> 39:12.210
Don't touch her!

561
39:13.070 --> 39:13.900
That voice

562
39:14.800 --> 39:15.860
sounds so familiar.

563
39:24.270 --> 39:25.820
Why is my malice in that thing?

564
39:55.070 --> 39:55.940
Has the mystical flower...?

565
39:56.150 --> 39:56.780
It's taken root.

566
39:59.880 --> 40:00.840
If you kill me,

567
40:00.840 --> 40:02.340
your flower will never bloom.

568
40:08.360 --> 40:10.130
Why are you carrying my malice?

569
40:10.520 --> 40:11.860
I've been watching closely.

570
40:12.000 --> 40:13.250
Earlier, the malice inside you

571
40:13.360 --> 40:14.590
was dispersed by her spirit essence.

572
40:14.630 --> 40:16.500
I was so desperate to possess someone

573
40:16.710 --> 40:18.170
and so greedy

574
40:18.400 --> 40:19.130
for a normal body

575
40:19.440 --> 40:20.300
that I accidentally

576
40:20.320 --> 40:21.420
attracted a wisp of your malice,

577
40:21.420 --> 40:22.300
which latched onto me.

578
40:23.320 --> 40:24.130
And the rest of my malice?

579
40:24.440 --> 40:25.980
It's already drifted out of Mount Qihuang.

580
40:26.480 --> 40:27.780
You'll have to go outside to find it.

581
40:28.230 --> 40:30.130
Once you reclaim all that malice,

582
40:30.320 --> 40:30.820
you'll be back

583
40:30.850 --> 40:32.870
at full strength.

584
40:32.870 --> 40:34.350
Then you'll have all the power you need

585
40:34.350 --> 40:35.380
to make the mystical flower bloom.

586
40:36.270 --> 40:36.780
As for the mystical flower,

587
40:36.840 --> 40:37.940
whether it grows in soil

588
40:37.960 --> 40:39.020
or on her head

589
40:39.170 --> 40:40.210
makes no difference.

590
40:40.210 --> 40:41.460
I'm telling the truth.

591
40:41.590 --> 40:44.210
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

592
40:44.320 --> 40:45.300
There's nothing

593
40:45.360 --> 40:47.380
I don't know about this world.

594
40:47.520 --> 40:48.820
Right now, the best thing you can do

595
40:48.880 --> 40:49.250
is

596
40:51.000 --> 40:52.250
leave Mount Qihuang.

597
41:00.800 --> 41:01.460
The Wanjun Lock...

598
41:02.360 --> 41:03.130
The immortal sects have begun

599
41:03.150 --> 41:03.980
reinforcing the seal.

600
42:35.070 --> 42:35.820
If you're here,

601
42:35.920 --> 42:36.730
how will you handle the Wanjun Lock?

602
42:36.920 --> 42:38.690
Just make sure the mystical flower stays safe.

603
42:42.320 --> 42:43.980
Where's that woman who's carrying

604
42:44.320 --> 42:44.980
my malice?

605
42:45.440 --> 42:46.130
Mount Leiguan.

606
42:48.710 --> 42:49.050
Someone...

607
42:50.480 --> 42:51.170
I really have no

608
42:51.190 --> 42:52.090
improper intentions toward you.

609
42:52.150 --> 42:53.300
I just want you to take me away!

610
43:13.660 --> 43:17.700
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

611
43:17.940 --> 43:21.380
♪So many longings♪

612
43:22.060 --> 43:24.140
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

613
43:24.340 --> 43:29.340
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

614
43:30.260 --> 43:34.300
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

615
43:34.540 --> 43:37.980
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

616
43:38.660 --> 43:40.740
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

617
43:40.940 --> 43:48.340
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

618
43:49.740 --> 43:53.420
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

619
43:53.660 --> 43:57.340
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

620
43:57.980 --> 44:01.540
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

621
44:01.860 --> 44:06.020
♪Still waits to come true♪

622
44:06.260 --> 44:09.940
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

623
44:10.500 --> 44:14.140
♪I'll stay by your side♪

624
44:14.620 --> 44:18.220
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

625
44:18.460 --> 44:25.780
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

626
44:39.260 --> 44:43.300
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

627
44:43.540 --> 44:46.980
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

628
44:47.660 --> 44:49.740
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

629
44:49.900 --> 44:57.340
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

630
44:58.260 --> 45:01.940
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

631
45:02.540 --> 45:06.140
♪I'll stay by your side♪

632
45:06.660 --> 45:10.220
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

633
45:10.460 --> 45:17.780
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
